{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":1722,"digest":"sha256:745a003561a41fccb8687b7183c544e5123c4274a88be58c38ecffb5868bd255","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-15T16:15:28Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T16:15:29Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/Lotulune/Copperbench/releases/download/v0.1.6-linux-stable/LINUX-RELEASE-AUTHORIZATION.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Lotulune/Copperbench/tarball/v0.1.6-linux-stable","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Lotulune/Copperbench/zipball/v0.1.6-linux-stable","body":"# Copperbench 0.1.6 — Linux x86_64\n\nLinux 0.1.6 的冻结候选已完成源码、下载字节与来源核验，尚待受保护流程晋级公开。产品改动与 [Windows 0.1.6](v0.1.6.md)一致，包括首作引导、草稿恢复、诊断定位、普通与精确交付、Native SDK 生命周期及双语路线文档。当前 Linux 公开包仍为 [0.1.5](current.md)。\n\n## 安装包\n\n本候选提供 Debian `.deb`、便携 `.tar.gz` 和图形安装向导 `Setup.tar.gz`，内置 JBR 25／JCEF 与独立 Java 21。目标环境保持 Ubuntu 24.04 LTS x86_64；其他发行版与架构未验证。\n\n发布后，图形安装包解压运行 `Install Copperbench`，便携版运行 `copperbench.sh`。Debian 安装命令为：\n\n```sh\nsudo apt install ./copperbench_0.1.6_amd64.deb\n```\n\n安装与设置见[Linux 安装说明](../user/linux-installation.md)。首次构建需要联网，Blockbench 单独安装。校验使用同一新 Release 的 `linux-candidate-sha256.txt`。\n\n## 冻结来源与校验\n\n- 产品源码：`9e3dfdeab1bc19c099e739bcda14940d9a6fee30`；成功的主线 push 候选运行 [38748273030](https://github.com/Lotulune/Copperbench/actions/runs/38748273030)，attempt 1。\n- 候选 ID：`sha256:ea64a9f7126e7cab62343780704837b62ffbd93010ae2603d0d2992444c508d1`。\n- Debian SHA-256：`b7b9a0a0d8e298f2f570a21b5a391e23a57bf9ec97b3fb8074c709e69d8353fd`。\n- 便携包 SHA-256：`bc90f7a83a8187eca7093e962fef526701867cfae650af471cb8bbd359ba7871`。\n- 图形安装包 SHA-256：`428db541820dd3d5c638f4d496b31b1630961a21da96b8e2462952ee1a880f67`。\n\n十三项候选必需 CI 步骤均成功，包括包结构、可执行权限、隔离 bootstrap、双语安装器预览、JCEF X11、Fabric／NeoForge 渲染预检、冻结元数据、来源证明和工件上传。独立下载核验通过全部八个冻结文件的哈希与来源证明；便携包中 23 项文档、SDK 和 schema 条目逐项出现一次且字节与源码 A 相同。两次本地 Sigstore 初始化失败与成功重试保留原记录。\n\n实际身份、证据与专属维护授权见[Linux 0.1.6 候选报告](../testing/maintenance-linux-0.1.6.md)。原始候选元数据保持不变，发布晋级还需草稿下载的逐字节比较。\n\n## 验收范围\n\n本次未重跑最终包完整 GNOME Wayland/Xorg 安装、升级、卸载、偏好迁移、Blockbench 往返、UI 持久化或 Minecraft 玩家玩法／同世界重开验收。`formalSupportClaim=false`、`fullInstalledAcceptance=not-repeated`。历史 VM、Linux run3 和旧游戏记录保留原来源与产物范围，未移作本候选的新验收。\n\nLinux 公开发布尚未完成；最终发布结果另记于[0.1.6 发布记录](../testing/maintenance-release-0.1.6.md)。\n"}
